{"seq":2,"slug":"jepa-mechanism","title":"JEPA 机制：联合嵌入与潜空间预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/jepa-mechanism","wordCount":1733,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"jepa-机制-联合嵌入与潜空间预测\">JEPA 机制：联合嵌入与潜空间预测</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把「在表征空间预测未来」从口号变成可训练的目标函数，需要精确回答三个问题：比较谁和谁、如何防止表征塌缩成一个常数、以及用什么任务迫使模型学到动力学。JEPA 的答案是三个网络加两条纪律。三个网络是编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、预测器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和目标编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\bar\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9315em;vertical-align:-0.2371em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4629em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2371em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；两条纪律是<strong>梯度只在在线侧流动</strong>（stop-gradient）与<strong>目标参数缓慢跟随在线参数</strong>（指数滑动平均）。整个系统没有解码器，从不回到像素空间——这是它与生成式建模范式的分界线，动机层面的论证见 <a href=\"why-not-generative\">为什么不生成像素</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    X[上下文块 x] --&gt; FE[在线编码器 f_theta]&#10;    Y[目标块 y] --&gt; FT[目标编码器 f_theta_bar]&#10;    FE --&gt; P[预测器 g_phi]&#10;    P --&gt; SY[预测表征 pred]&#10;    FT --&gt; TY[目标表征 target&lt;br/&gt;stop-gradient]&#10;    SY --&gt; L{L1 或 L2 损失}&#10;    TY --&gt; L&#10;    L -.-&gt;|梯度| FE&#10;    L -.-&gt;|梯度| P&#10;    FT -.-&gt;|EMA 缓慢更新| FE\">flowchart TD\n    X[上下文块 x] --&gt; FE[在线编码器 f_theta]\n    Y[目标块 y] --&gt; FT[目标编码器 f_theta_bar]\n    FE --&gt; P[预测器 g_phi]\n    P --&gt; SY[预测表征 pred]\n    FT --&gt; TY[目标表征 target&lt;br/&gt;stop-gradient]\n    SY --&gt; L{L1 或 L2 损失}\n    TY --&gt; L\n    L -.-&gt;|梯度| FE\n    L -.-&gt;|梯度| P\n    FT -.-&gt;|EMA 缓慢更新| FE</pre><h2 id=\"目标函数的数学骨架\">目标函数的数学骨架</h2><p>设输入为图像或视频片段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，从中选出上下文部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 与待预测部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。前向过程为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_x = f_\\theta(x), \\qquad \\hat{s}_y = g_\\phi(s_x), \\qquad s_y = f_{\\bar\\theta}(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\